  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br><br>지능형과학실ON에 <br>새로운 기능이 생겼습니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d94fc27c9a044995c63ec1276d57409770209829\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d94fc27c9a044995c63ec1276d57409770209829\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"212\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br>모둠 학생들이 </span></span></b><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">실험보고서를 동시에 편집 작성할 수 있는 기능</span></b>입니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">꼭 실험보고서가 아닌</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모둠별로 글을 작성할때 활용할 수도<br>있을 것 같습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">직접 해보았습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fad80dec67b21f4d843af7c307dc0d8ee5bef7b0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fad80dec67b21f4d843af7c307dc0d8ee5bef7b0\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"934\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">색깔이 다른 것은 다른 회원(학생)이 작성한 것을 의미합니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">누가 얼마만큼 어떤 내용을 작성하였는지 알 수 있습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a74adf9b28e35d0f3d1dd7fb8fd36f4676c61e44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a74adf9b28e35d0f3d1dd7fb8fd36f4676c61e44\" data-origin-width=\"1899\" data-origin-height=\"922\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 수정을 하면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">누가 수정하였는지 색이 다르게 나타납니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e1514192e8093b963a613af9a1fe2641e30f0d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e1514192e8093b963a613af9a1fe2641e30f0d\" data-origin-width=\"1917\" data-origin-height=\"913\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 사진 모둠 대표가 아닌 학생이 보고서 제출을 눌렀을때</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81999321f41e9c8846b5383a028889bd3e8a884f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81999321f41e9c8846b5383a028889bd3e8a884f\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"940\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모둠 대표 학생이 보고서 제출을 눌렀을때</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">보고서 최종 제출은</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">모둠 대표만 할수 있어요.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이제 <span style=\"color: #000000;\">무임승차시 운임의 30배를 부과할 수 있습니다</span> </span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223891278972\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223891278972</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"지능형과학실ON 탐구수업 보고서 실시간 공동편집 기능\" data-og-description=\"■ 「지능형 과학실 ON」 탐구수업 보고서 실시간 공동편집 기능(협업보고서) 안내 1. [교사] 협업보고서...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223891278972\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/